770
01:08:09,208 --> 01:08:11,958
dan para manusia!

771
01:08:12,041 --> 01:08:14,666
Ya!

772
01:08:14,750 --> 01:08:17,916
Menurutku ini gawat.

773
01:08:18,000 --> 01:08:20,166
Aku takut itu sudah terlambat.

774
01:08:20,250 --> 01:08:26,250
<i>- Apa yang harus kita lakukan?</i>
<i>- Topus Terrentus akan lenyap</i>

775
01:08:27,916 --> 01:08:31,583
<i>Saatnya bertindak</i>
<i>dan menentukan nasib kita</i>

776
01:08:31,666 --> 01:08:35,291
<i>Tanpa bimbingan Keluarga Kerajaan</i>

777
01:08:35,375 --> 01:08:39,125
<i>Aku memutuskan untuk bersekongkol</i>
<i>Karena kerajaan dalam bahaya</i>

778
01:08:39,208 --> 01:08:42,833
<i>Seperti hak leluhur kita</i>

779
01:08:42,916 --> 01:08:46,500
<i>Untuk menyelamatkan Topus Terrentus</i>

780
01:08:46,583 --> 01:08:50,375
<i>Buat perjanjian untuk spesies kita</i>

781
01:08:50,458 --> 01:08:53,375
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

782
01:08:53,458 --> 01:08:57,875
<i>Dan dia akan menghancurkan kita semua</i>

783
01:08:57,958 --> 01:08:59,666
<i>- Siapa?</i>
<i>- Siapa?</i>

784
01:08:59,750 --> 01:09:01,500
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

785
01:09:01,583 --> 01:09:05,875
<i>Dia mencintai manusia</i>
<i>dan ingin menggantikan kita</i>

786
01:09:05,958 --> 01:09:09,916
<i>Semua yang kita capai</i>
<i>Akan segera hilang karena dia</i>

787
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:13,208
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

788
01:09:13,291 --> 01:09:17,375
<i>Dan alam kita, dia akan hancurkan</i>

789
01:09:17,458 --> 01:09:20,458
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

790
01:09:20,541 --> 01:09:24,958
<i>Dan dia akan menghancurkan kita semua</i>

791
01:09:25,041 --> 01:09:26,458
<i>Siapa?</i>

792
01:09:26,541 --> 01:09:28,500
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

793
01:09:28,583 --> 01:09:34,458
<i>Pria dan wanita, makhluk yang ada</i>

794
01:09:34,541 --> 01:09:37,416
<i>Yang tak mengerti tempat mereka</i>

795
01:09:37,500 --> 01:09:43,375
<i>Mereka pikir mereka sangat penting</i>
<i>Di dunia biasa mereka</i>

796
01:09:43,458 --> 01:09:46,458
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

797
01:09:46,541 --> 01:09:50,041
<i>Dalam mimpinya, dia akan memenjarakan kita</i>

798
01:09:50,875 --> 01:09:54,083
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

799
01:09:54,166 --> 01:09:58,375
<i>Dan dia akan mencoba mengurung kita</i>

800
01:09:58,458 --> 01:09:59,916
<i>Siapa?</i>

801
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:01,958
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

802
01:10:02,041 --> 01:10:06,166
<i>Kami diasingkan karena raja</i>

803
01:10:06,250 --> 01:10:11,000
<i>Klan bersatu tanpa takhta atau hukum</i>

804
01:10:11,083 --> 01:10:13,875
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

805
01:10:13,958 --> 01:10:18,250
<i>Tradisi kita akan dia hancurkan</i>

806
01:10:18,333 --> 01:10:21,458
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

807
01:10:21,541 --> 01:10:25,875
<i>Dan dia akan membungkam kita</i>

808
01:10:25,958 --> 01:10:27,416
<i>Siapa?</i>

809
01:10:27,500 --> 01:10:29,583
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

810
01:10:29,666 --> 01:10:32,958
<i>Saatnya bertindak</i>
<i>Tangkap raja dan ratu</i>

811
01:10:33,041 --> 01:10:37,208
<i>Dan biarkan orang lain</i>

812
01:10:37,291 --> 01:10:41,000
<i>Memerintah kita sekarang</i>

813
01:10:41,083 --> 01:10:43,250
Bagaimana? Kalian bersamaku?

814
01:10:43,333 --> 01:10:45,625
Ya!

815
01:10:46,541 --> 01:10:50,250
<i>Hentikan pemberontakan ini</i>

816
01:10:50,333 --> 01:10:54,000
<i>Kumohon, mari bersikap bijak</i>

817
01:10:54,083 --> 01:10:57,500
<i>Yang kau bicarakan adalah pengkhianatan</i>

818
01:10:57,583 --> 01:11:01,500
- <i>Kali ini, bertindaklah terhormat</i>
- Akhirnya!

819
01:11:01,583 --> 01:11:04,666
<i>Dia mencari pilihan</i>

820
01:11:04,750 --> 01:11:09,041
<i>Demi menyelamatkan kenyataan kita</i>

821
01:11:09,125 --> 01:11:11,916
<i>Dia mencari pilihan</i>

822
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:16,125
<i>Untuk membantu kita berkembang</i>

823
01:11:16,208 --> 01:11:18,125
<i>- Siapa?</i>
<i>- Siapa?</i>

824
01:11:18,208 --> 01:11:20,541
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

825
01:11:31,708 --> 01:11:34,416
Jangan ganggu dia, Para Pengkhianat!

826
01:11:34,958 --> 01:11:38,291
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

827
01:11:38,375 --> 01:11:42,583
<i>Dan dia akan menghancurkan kita semua</i>

828
01:11:42,666 --> 01:11:44,416
<i>Siapa?</i>

829
01:11:44,500 --> 01:11:47,166
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

830
01:11:47,250 --> 01:11:49,666
- Mari kita turunkan raja dan ratu!
- Ya!

831
01:11:50,333 --> 01:11:53,791
<i>Aku pernah ke sini</i>

832
01:11:53,875 --> 01:11:58,333
<i>Terpenjara di sel</i>

833
01:11:58,416 --> 01:12:02,083
<i>Aku pernah ke sini</i>

834
01:12:02,166 --> 01:12:06,666
<i>Dibutakan oleh harapan</i>

835
01:12:06,750 --> 01:12:10,041
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianatiku</i>

836
01:12:10,125 --> 01:12:13,750
<i>Pengkhianat! Tak pernah kuduga</i>

837
01:12:14,666 --> 01:12:18,208
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianatiku!</i>

838
01:12:18,291 --> 01:12:22,875
<i>Dia bilang aku bisa memercayainya!</i>

839
01:12:22,958 --> 01:12:24,083
<i>Siapa?</i>

840
01:12:24,166 --> 01:12:26,291
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

841
01:12:26,375 --> 01:12:31,416
<i>Tenang, alam kita akan bangkit lagi</i>

842
01:12:32,208 --> 01:12:34,958
<i>Ini hanya perubahan arah</i>

843
01:12:35,041 --> 01:12:40,291
<i>Cerita yang akan menjadi kenyataan</i>

844
01:12:40,375 --> 01:12:42,958
<i>Dia akan menulisnya</i>

845
01:12:43,041 --> 01:12:46,125
<i>Dia punya pilihan lain</i>

846
01:12:46,208 --> 01:12:50,916
<i>Untuk menyelamatkan realitas kita</i>

847
01:12:51,000 --> 01:12:54,333
<i>Dia punya pilihan lain</i>

848
01:12:54,416 --> 01:12:59,166
<i>Untuk membantu kita berkembang</i>

849
01:12:59,250 --> 01:13:00,625
<i>Siapa?</i>

850
01:13:00,708 --> 01:13:02,833
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

851
01:13:02,916 --> 01:13:08,666
<i>Alamku dalam krisis</i>

852
01:13:08,750 --> 01:13:14,000
<i>Orang tuaku sakit</i>

853
01:13:14,083 --> 01:13:19,208
<i>Dan Frankelda membenciku</i>

854
01:13:19,291 --> 01:13:25,291
<i>Itulah kesalahanku</i>

855
01:13:25,375 --> 01:13:29,083
<i>Aku pengkhianat</i>

856
01:13:29,166 --> 01:13:32,375
<i>Aku makhluk gagal!</i>

857
01:13:32,958 --> 01:13:36,041
<i>Akulah pengkhianat</i>

858
01:13:36,125 --> 01:13:40,291
<i>Akulah yang harus disalahkan!</i>

859
01:13:40,375 --> 01:13:42,166
<i>Kau siapa?</i>

860
01:13:42,250 --> 01:13:43,875
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

861
01:13:43,958 --> 01:13:47,875
<i>Mari selamatkan Topus Terrentus</i>

862
01:13:47,958 --> 01:13:51,625
<i>Agar kaum kita bisa berdamai</i>

863
01:13:51,708 --> 01:13:54,708
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

864
01:13:54,791 --> 01:13:59,083
<i>Dan dia akan menghancurkan alam kita</i>

865
01:13:59,166 --> 01:14:02,166
<i>Dia sudah mengkhianati kita</i>

866
01:14:02,250 --> 01:14:06,666
<i>Dan dia akan menghancurkan kita semua</i>

867
01:14:06,750 --> 01:14:08,333
<i>Siapa?</i>

868
01:14:08,416 --> 01:14:10,541
<i>Pangeran Teror!</i>

869
01:14:13,875 --> 01:14:16,541
Demi kebenaran dan fiksi!

870
01:14:16,625 --> 01:14:20,500
- Hidup raja dan ratu!
- Hidup raja dan ratu!

871
01:14:20,583 --> 01:14:22,583
Serang!

872
01:14:33,625 --> 01:14:35,541
Awas!

873
01:15:03,708 --> 01:15:05,541
Tidak! Yalabus!

874
01:15:12,041 --> 01:15:14,500
Tangkap para konspirator!

875
01:15:14,583 --> 01:15:15,416
Ayo!

876
01:15:15,500 --> 01:15:16,750
Tidak!

877
01:15:16,833 --> 01:15:18,833
Jangan lihat matanya!

878
01:15:24,833 --> 01:15:27,791
Bawa dia padaku.

879
01:15:34,750 --> 01:15:36,625
Kaum Tecothia!

880
01:15:36,708 --> 01:15:38,916
Kalian bersumpah melindungi raja dan ratu!

881
01:15:40,958 --> 01:15:44,583
Kalian akan mematuhi Procustes.

882
01:15:45,500 --> 01:15:48,500
Tentu saja, Lady Siren.

883
01:15:54,416 --> 01:15:56,833
Kemenangan!

884
01:16:03,333 --> 01:16:05,916
Ikuti aku,
Para Pemimpin yang Menakutkan.

885
01:16:06,000 --> 01:16:09,375
Sudah waktunya semuanya berubah selamanya.

886
01:16:17,916 --> 01:16:20,916
- Mythelitas, kumohon!
- Diam.

887
01:16:21,000 --> 01:16:23,625
Berhenti! Kumohon, berhenti!

888
01:16:23,708 --> 01:16:27,250
Bawa aku dan lepaskan dia! Tidak!

889
01:16:27,833 --> 01:16:30,000
Kau memaksaku.

890
01:16:30,875 --> 01:16:33,083
Mainkan cerita ini.

891
01:16:38,083 --> 01:16:40,291
Mahakaryaku!

892
01:16:40,375 --> 01:16:44,166
Cerita tentang Totolina kita
yang berbakat,

893
01:16:44,250 --> 01:16:50,458
